  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>rupatadine</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>R06AX28</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>two compartments, oral dosing <small>(PK_2C_enteral)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Santamaría E et al. 2017</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>6-11 year olds with allergic rhinitis</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>rupatadine</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_rupatadine/Rupatadine_Santamara2017_base\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>ka (h–1)</td><td>0.53</td><td>h–1</td><td><small>kabs</small></td></tr><tr><td>Lag time (h)</td><td>0.22</td><td>h</td><td><small>tlag</small></td></tr><tr><td>CL/F(L/h)</td><td>547</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vc/F (L)</td><td>102</td><td>L</td><td><small>V1/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>CLd/F (L/h)</td><td>208</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>Q/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vp/F (L)</td><td>1540</td><td>L</td><td><small>V2/F</small></td></tr></table><h4>About rupatadine</h4><p>Rupatadine is an antihistamine used to relieve symptoms of allergic conditions such as allergic rhinitis and urticaria. It is approved and used in several countries, though it is not authorised by the European Medicines Agency.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q423450\">Wikidata Q423450</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Rupatadine\">Rupatadine</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Santamaría E et al. (2017). Population pharmacokinetic modelling of rupatadine solution in 6-11 year olds and optimisation of the experimental design in younger children. <i>PloS one 12(4):e0176091</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0176091\">10.1371/journal.pone.0176091</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28419164\">28419164</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Santamaría_2017: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
